# Page objects

- One class per page; extend `BasePage`.
- Multi-strategy configs **only for fragile controls** (≥2 real alternatives) in `src/pages/locators/<page>.locators.ts`.
- Stable `#id`, `data-qa`, or scoped CSS: `() => this.page.locator(...)` on the page — do not wrap in `.or()`.
- Fallbacks: ordered `strategies` → `locatorFrom` / `this.loc()` builds Playwright `.or()` + `.first()`.
- Strategy order: `role` → `placeholder` / `label` → `css` → `text` (optional `testId`). Use `root` to scope forms.
- Shared UI (e.g. cart modal): one file under `src/pages/locators/`, import from both pages.
- Call `dismissBlockingOverlays()` before fragile clicks if ads/consent may block.
- Register new pages in `src/fixtures/index.ts` with `pageFixture(XPage)`.
